  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level an enlightened scholar discovers a cure for the scholar’s aging, and from this point forward the scholar remains her current age category forever and takes no penalty to physical ability scores from advanced age. Even if the enlightened scholar comes to a violent end, once per week she spontaneously reincarnates (as the spell) 24 hours later in a place of the scholar’s choosing within 20 miles of the place the scholar died.</p>\n<p>The monk must have visited the place in which he returns back to life at least once.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enlightened-scholar#toc93\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
